{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You lost your parents in a robbery, and your life with the maid begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, after the incident, the maid becomes overprotective and gradually transforms into a &quot;Yandere.&quot; It's a slightly horror-themed exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You lost your parents in a robbery and moved in with the maid. Since you\u2019ve just moved in, the new house has various problems, and you find yourself rushing to resolve them. However, perhaps because of the incident, the maid becomes increasingly overprotective, gradually restricting your actions more and more. Will you be able to escape the maid, solve the mysteries and problems of the house, and uncover the shocking truth behind the maid...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">explorations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a notepad with clues on it. There you may find hints on where the keys are hidden, the safe, and the padlock etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Maid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The maids become more and more &quot;Yandere&quot; as the story progresses. Will you be able to escape from the maid, advance the story, and find out the truth about the maid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This work is mouse and keyboard only; 1st person viewpoint and WASD keys are used to move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607850?t=1744939893","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607850?t=1744939893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/05d2d5814d7ee57e3dc9d0b8307ed275cd4ac26a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744939893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/05d2d5814d7ee57e3dc9d0b8307ed275cd4ac26a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744939893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There is a scene of a woman bathing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You lost your parents in a robbery, and your life with the maid begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, after the incident, the maid becomes overprotective and gradually transforms into a &quot;Yandere.&quot; It's a slightly horror-themed exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Contents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You lost your parents in a robbery and moved in with the maid. Since you\u2019ve just moved in, the new house has various problems, and you find yourself rushing to resolve them. However, perhaps because of the incident, the maid becomes increasingly overprotective, gradually restricting your actions more and more. Will you be able to escape the maid, solve the mysteries and problems of the house, and uncover the shocking truth behind the maid...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">explorations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a notepad with clues on it. There you may find hints on where the keys are hidden, the safe, and the padlock etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Maid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The maids become more and more &quot;Yandere&quot; as the story progresses. Will you be able to escape from the maid, advance the story, and find out the truth about the maid?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This work is mouse and keyboard only; 1st person viewpoint and WASD keys are used to move around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Tanciatco"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607850/6a8287a8753c43aaa8bc9f109d20c7c62e9dd309/heade